$DTYPE RXN:VAR(1):EXP_PROC
$DATUM 3-Bromo-1-ethyl-1H-pyrrole-2,5-dione (0.250 g, 1.23 mM) was added to
4-((tert-butoxycarbonylamino)-methyl)phenylboronic acid (0.308 g, 1.23
mM), PdCl2(dppf) (0.067 g, 0.09 mM) and cesium fluoride (0.372 g, 2.45
mM) in dioxane (10 mL) at 20 °C. The reaction was degassed with nitrogen
for 10 minutes and then heated at 70 °C for 1 hour. The reaction mixture
was filtered through celite and the filtrate was concentrated in vacuo.
The crude product was purified by flash silica chromatography with an
elution gradient of 50 to 100% diethyl ether in heptane. Pure fractions
were evaporated to dryness. tert-butyl
4-(1-ethyl-2,5-dioxo-2,5-dihydro-1H-pyrrol-3-yl)benzylcarbamate (0.305 g,
75 %) as a yellow gum.
